.TH swarm-mirror-export 1  "swarm 0.2.2" "Swarmgit manual"
.SH NAME
swarm\-mirror\-export \- Write DIR/<repo\-id>/repo.swarmbundle; serve DIR with any web server
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBswarm mirror export\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fILINK\fR> <\fIDIR\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Write DIR/<repo\-id>/repo.swarmbundle; serve DIR with any web server
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fILINK\fR>
A repo ID or link
.TP
<\fIDIR\fR>
Directory to write into
